WEBVTT

00:05:30.126 --> 00:05:32.316
In just 45 minutes of flying,

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:35.134
the LiDAR had collected
the same amount of data

00:05:35.158 --> 00:05:38.083
as what would have taken decades by hand:

00:05:38.107 --> 00:05:39.637
every house foundation,

00:05:39.661 --> 00:05:42.274
building, road and pyramid,

00:05:42.298 --> 00:05:44.330
incredible detail,

00:05:44.354 --> 00:05:47.600
representing the lives
of thousands of people

00:05:47.624 --> 00:05:50.809
who lived and loved and died
in these spaces.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:54.565
And what's more, the quality of the data

00:05:54.589 --> 00:05:57.640
wasn't comparable to traditional
archaeological research.

00:05:58.442 --> 00:06:00.398
It was much, much better.